Package: aps
Title: Adversarial Parameter Selection for Monte Carlo Simulations
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Austin", "Jang", , "austin.jang@yale.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for adversarial parameter selection in Monte Carlo simulation
    studies. Uses Bayesian optimization with deep ensembles to identify parameter
    configurations that expose worst-case method performance. Includes diagnostics
    for tracking optimization progress and model quality.
